      "content": "i already tried calling the doctor but they're closed for the weekend since it's sunday. he seems okay otherwise, just a bit fussy and warm. i dont want to deal with the er wait if it's just a standard viral thing. could it just be a common thing like roseola or something? it seems like a lot of trouble for just a rash.",
